| SEI @100 cyc (1C) | ≤ 500 nm | **9.087 nm** | ✅ |
| −20 °C retention | ≥ 90% | **99.571%** (5.04452/5.06626 Ah); true-soak cross-check identical, T_max 266.71 K | ✅ |
| SEI @500 cyc | ≤ 550 nm | **25.317 nm** | ✅ |

### Design levers (each simulation-grounded, no fabricated values)
