- Porosity 0.335/0.25→0.40/0.40 (R6 pre-registered probe: strictly non-worse on all axes → adopted per rule)

### Honest annotations carried in the deliverables
1. **Volume-fraction consistency**: active vf (0.665/0.75) + porosity 0.40 > 1 in model bookkeeping — interpreted as replacing unmodeled binder/additive volume.
